<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower in active trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 568.71, down 9.19.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 416 to 157.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.20.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 21,047,980 compared with 23,344,260 on Thursday. The market was closed Friday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
